OL,3,GNEWSASiblings told not to give mum
OL,4,Amedication, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA well-known hotelier and his sister
OL,7,Faccused of murdering their 100-year-old
OL,8,Fmother were warned not to give her any
OL,9,Fmore pain medication, a court has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FOxford restaurateur Jeremy Mogford, 79,
OL,13,Fand his sister Sarah Pickering, 72,
OL,14,Fdeny murdering their mother, Pamela
OL,15,FMogford, in Bledlow Ridge,
OL,16,FBuckinghamshire.
OL,18,FA jury heard they admit administering
OL,19,Ffurther morphine before she died on 15
OL,20,FFebruary 2022, but only "to ease her
OL,21,Fpain".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
